    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Seeker is an immersive hidden object game where you will explore a dark office shrouded in mystery. As a brave seeker, you'll wander through eerie corridors filled with puzzles and secrets. Your main goal is to find hidden objects that will help you uncover the story behind the mysterious events occurring in this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the dark secrets of the office as you conquer your fears and overcome various challenges. With each item you find, you will get closer to solving the mystery, but be careful\u2014darkness hides many dangers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating atmosphere of a nighttime adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing puzzles and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique items to explore and collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic graphics and sound design that create a sense of tension</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Seeker is your gateway into a world of darkness and mystery. Are you ready to uncover what this haunting office hides?</p>",
